{'symbol': 'KEY', 'date': '2022-05-05 11:25:00', 'title': "KEY FAMILY WEALTH RECOGNIZED FOR 'BEST FAMILY OFFICE SOLUTION' AT THE 2022 FAMILY WEALTH REPORT AWARDS", 'text': 'CLEVELAND, MAY 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KEY FAMILY WEALTH, THE MULTI-FAMILY OFFICE DIVISION OF KEY PRIVATE BANK, WAS NAMED "BEST FAMILY OFFICE SOLUTION" AT THE 2022 FAMILY WEALTH REPORT (FWR) AWARDS. THE FWR AWARDS SHOWCASE HIGH-PERFORMING PROVIDERS IN GLOBAL PRIVATE BANKING, WEALTH MANAGEMENT AND ADVISOR COMMUNITIES.'}{'symbol': 'KEY', 'date': '2022-05-05 10:00:00', 'title': "KEYBANK WEALTH MANAGEMENT'S JOE CALABRESE HONORED WITH LIFETIME ACHIEVEMENT AWARD AT THE 2022 FAMILY WEALTH REPORT AWARDS", 'text': 'CLEVELAND, MAY 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KEY PRIVATE BANK, THE WEALTH MANAGEMENT DIVISION OF KEYCORP (NYSE: KEY), PROUDLY ANNOUNCES TODAY THAT CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER JOE CALABRESE RECEIVED THE LIFETIME ACHIEVEMENT AWARD AS PART OF THE 2022 FAMILY WEALTH REPORT AWARDS. THIS AWARD RECOGNIZES INDIVIDUALS WHO HAVE DEDICATED THEIR CAREERS IN WEALTH MANAGEMENT TO PUTTING THE NEEDS OF THE FAMILIES THEY SERVE FIRST.'}